   '2025-11-01', null, '2026-10-16T00:00:00Z', '60a4e4f91753c6906d210af36b53142ae551360b5e43664f85dd05b99e920259', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: the DA PAM 611-21 (Smartbook) cover reads "End of Fiscal Year 2025 … November 2025"; no day is stated, so the 1st is used. The chapter was posted on api.army.mil on 2025-12-04. Individual specifications carry their own effective dates (e.g. "Effective 202610"); those are stored per passage, not per source. Skill levels map to grades by Table 9-2 (ch. 9, PDF p. 26): 1=E-1..E-4, 2=E-5, 3=E-6, 4=E-7, 5=E-8, 6=E-9. Only duties are stored; physical demands, qualifications, ASIs, restrictions and standards-of-grade tables are requirements, not duties, and are skipped (counted in the report). LIMITATIONS: the standards-of-grade tables (ch. 10d) and enlisted career-progression charts (ch. 10a) are not imported.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-611-21-enlisted-ch10c@2026-10-16', '40b4459b669038d841522eccd244743d16fd63c186d9a6724d5cec9f7a6efcfa')
on conflict (id) do update set
