(d) Plans and Ops Team Leader
(e) Human Resource Officer.
(f) Joint HR/Manpower Staff Officer.
(g) Postal Officer (with skill 4J).
(h) Platoon Leader (Postal, Multi-functional HR).', 'f87ad7f3b25b64da9e69811c401e4cfc79ff4b0b1ba84f8ce0c562e7176a96d9', 80, 80, null, 79, null, null, false, null),
  ('b0d9e5d1-916e-5dfe-a8d0-655fe79099ce', '7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', '42C', 'ARMY MUSIC', 'general_duties', null, null, 'Description of duties', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 3 (officer branches and functional areas)', 'Plans, develops, and directs activities of Army bands and musical training of Army Musicians. Coordinates all band activities of the command. Conducts technical inspections and evaluates operational status, technical capability and proficiency of command bands.', '7920804cae30c0c68c77097cc673c5ccf9f3c0b9563c33dc9ae6411536ab00d6', 80, 80, null, 80, null, null, false, null),
  ('10cbd1c5-f594-5dae-bb32-152dcb6485be', '7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', '42C', 'ARMY MUSIC', 'assignments', null, null, 'Unique duty positions', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 3 (officer branches and functional areas)', '(a) Band Commander.
(b) Commander, Army School of Music.
(c) Staff Band Officer.
(d) Unit Band Officer.
(e) Instructor, Army School of Music.', '2837b4daf6c606e697ba3796fab2670776f3c6ba002089cd71bccd4c53af10a0', 81, 81, null, 81, null, null, false, null),
  ('1f5b0fc9-276a-5c5e-9924-5893a2c97d52', '7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', '42H', 'SENIOR HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER', 'general_duties', null, null, 'Description of duties', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 3 (officer branches and functional areas)', 'Leads, commands, manages and/or directs the HR military life cycle functions that support HR policy formulation, interpretation, coordination, integration and implementation at all echelons. They serve in positions requiring HR experience at HR company, brigade/BCT, divisions, Corps, theater, ACOM, HQDA, Joint and DoD levels.', '2b60b6a9f255baec875064d26e56f68b290874f8d2370a5e74df9b0e543bd9cb', 81, 81, null, 82, null, null, false, null),
  ('685492f0-c7a4-5149-9b9c-31b7d1c03a40', '7a6a4906-e811-5fb6-97fc-206842efb40c', 'Army', 'officer', '42H', 'SENIOR HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER', 'grades_authorized', null, null, 'Special grading of positions', 'DA PAM 611-21, ch. 3 (officer branches and functional areas)', 'Positions graded MAJ through COL.', 'c109e5215957813e4286bae0ec3dc4f5b8c80503cce030081e2ca47c84ab8d50', 81, 81, null, 83, null, null, false, null),
