(j) Chief of Logistics, MEDCEN/MEDDAC.
(k) Chief, Personnel Division/Branch MEDCEN/MEDDAC.
(l) Chief, Resource Management Division MEDCEN/MEDDAC.
(m) Chief, Clinical Support Division.
(n) Executive Officer, Dental Activity (DENTAC).
(o) Chief, Health Services Admin Support Branch.
(p) Chief, Ambulatory Care Support Branch.
(q) Executive Officer, Medical Company.
