values ('a494f860-7b94-5225-8353-49f9a654bd1c', 'Army', 'enlisted', 'DA PAM 600-25', 'Finance and Comptroller (CMF 36) Career Progression Plan', null, 'CMF 36', 'Commandant, U.S. Army Finance and Comptroller School (Proponency Division), Fort Jackson, SC', 'https://api.army.mil/e2/c/downloads/2024/07/19/be500779/cmf-36-da-pam-600-25-19-jul-24.pdf',
   '2024-07-19', null, '2026-10-15T00:00:00Z', '799eb94c0eb379df17e07d5037d2a3cc391eb89644ec982d0eda37fab526b660', 'extracted', 'unreviewed', 'Date basis: 19 Jul 2024 comes from the official file name, the server Last-Modified header, and the Army G-1 listing (checked 2026-10-15). The PDF body prints no date. A separate CMF 36 board brief dated 25 Aug 2025 is a different document and is not imported. Review correction 2026-10-16: Chapter 6 mixes text for the whole Reserve Component with ARNG-only text; paragraph a(1) and items e and f are tagged Guard-only (see componentRules in the manifest). LIMITATIONS: Only MOS 36B is included. Chapter 5 only points to an online career map. In the Reserve/Guard chapter, one sentence in item d mentions ARNG promotion regulations inside otherwise Reserve Component text.', 'pdf-parse 2.4.5', 'army-cmf36-dapam600-25-2024-07-19@2026-10-16', 'dc76a020456cda4091863375d648d8787b3e313ebc9bb30188c1a94ecf843d70')
